      "title": "From Duchess to Scullery Maid",
      "start_block": "B027",
      "end_block": "B069",
      "hook": "Lady Ashbourne glares down at Catherine kneeling in the mud and snaps, 'You dare show your face in Ashbourne courtyard?'",
      "cliffhanger": "Catherine's trembling hands reach out and take the coarse apron and clattering iron keys as she chokes out, 'I accept, Your Grace.'",
      "why": "A scheming noblewoman is publicly humiliated and forced to accept servitude, with the power dynamic reversed in front of the whole estate.",
      "context_gap": "A stranger may not know Catherine poisoned the Dowager Duchess or that Juliana is the new Duchess."
    },
    {
      "title": "The Priest Cannot Break Us",
      "start_block": "B012",
      "end_block": "B024",
      "hook": "Juliana trembles and asks, 'What if Father Thomas sways the High Council? What if they strip your title? Because of me?'",
      "cliffhanger": "Alexander vows, 'We will stand before the King and God again within ten days. Nothing breaks that.'",
      "why": "An emotional, high-stakes reassurance scene that establishes the couple's bond against a powerful enemy, ending on a defiant promise.",
      "context_gap": "A stranger may not know the High Priest invalidated their marriage or that Alexander is secretly the rightful Duke."
    },
    {
      "title": "Take the Apron or Leave",
      "start_block": "B040",
      "end_block": "B069",
      "hook": "Juliana raises her hand and commands 'Stop,' halting the guard about to drag Catherine away.",
      "cliffhanger": "Catherine's trembling hands reach out and take the coarse apron and clattering iron keys as she chokes out, 'I accept, Your Grace.'",
      "why": "The heroine turns a moment of vengeance into a calculated humiliation, forcing her enemy to choose between servitude and exile.",
      "context_gap": "A stranger may not know Catherine tried to destroy Juliana or that Juliana is now the Duchess of Ashbourne."
    }
  ],
